om/avatar/c693/ed56/788432_normal.png?m=1793780362\" alt=\"vaxshoot\" data-uid=\"788432\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>18</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/94nb\">94nb</a> #7 我是用的 hermes 桌面端+tg 多一些，主要帮我做一些杂活，你说的 studio 听起来像是多 agent 调度？能共享记忆和工具么？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18266413\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6016/c49e/22864_normal.png?m=1792149451\" alt=\"oldcai\" data-uid=\"22864\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>25</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>gemini 虽然编码不太好，但是的确有人味。上次那个谁的找骂提示词骂的我最破防😂</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18266511\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c9b860060a07207b6c4bdab91daf0d4b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"vastlogic\" data-uid=\"838355\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>26</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>这种感觉确实是 Gemini 独有的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18266533\">\n        \n        